    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to introduce No. 3 Auburn Villas, Rathgar to the market, a handsome Victorian residence of exceptional character, privacy and presence quietly positioned in the heart of Rathgar.\r\n\r\nTucked quietly away in one of Rathgar’s most discreet and leafy enclaves, this is a handsome double-fronted Victorian residence dating from 1847. Set behind its distinctive granite steps, this impressive home retains the elegance, proportions and architectural character of its period.\r\n\r\nAuburn Villas is a leafy, secluded cul-de-sac just off Rathgar Road, offering an exceptional sense of privacy while remaining within easy walking distance of Rathgar Village. The location is hard to rival, with an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants and boutiques nearby, while Bushy Park and the River Dodder are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nInside, the house offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation with a wealth of period detail and a wonderful sense of scale. The principal reception rooms are particularly impressive, reflecting the architectural quality and stature of a house of this era."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Garden Level\r\nA modern kitchen with French oak flooring, fitted alder units and a central island with polished granite worktop opens directly onto the patio and approximately 80ft rear garden. There is also a family room with brick open fireplace, utility room, cloakroom and a bedroom. \r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nA wide, light-filled entrance hall leads to the elegant drawing room and dining room, positioned to either side. The dining room retains original floorboards and a marble fireplace with inset tiles and brass surround.\r\n\r\nFirst-Floor Return\r\nStudy/child’s bedroom and bathroom. \r\n\r\nUpper Floor\r\nTwo generous bedrooms, both with dressing rooms, original fireplaces and en suite shower rooms.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a remarkable private garden extending to approximately 80ft enjoying a SE aspect. Mature planting and established greenery create a secluded setting and offer considerable scope for family life, entertaining and further enhancement.\r\n\r\nWhilst in need of some updating properties of this calibre and setting seldom come to the market. 3 Auburn Villas combines Victorian grandeur, exceptional privacy, a blank canvas and an extraordinary garden, all within one of Dublin’s most established and sought-after neighbourhoods."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E"
      }
